    "observations": [
      "Yuki loop uses a bounded request index and three typed owners; Pi's AgentContext, mutable config, nested unbounded loops and open hooks are not installed or invoked.",
      "Yuki frames and records use its own ChatResponse and ToolCall types and immutable Python dataclasses.",
      "Yuki state is a derived immutable projection; the Pi Agent object's mutable state and lifecycle are not reused.",
      "Yuki EventStream is a bounded synchronous deque with diagnostic dropping; Pi's async iterator, waiter queues and final-result promises are not reused."
    ]
  },
